    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, craft, farm, and build  as a Cat  in Cats and Cows. Paint and design your island landscape, build farms and expand your island to build your farming empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm from a selection of 14 different crops!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/0aa009d80ea806254686d3448dbf11e4.poster.avif?t=1750793090\" width=400 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/0aa009d80ea806254686d3448dbf11e4.webm?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/0aa009d80ea806254686d3448dbf11e4.mp4?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with less exotic crops, then sell and trade to acquire more exotic and expensive crops! Each crop can either be sold for money or can be traded for landscape block to expand your island.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect materials around your island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/1d270a958d9d37663666b29e69ea33c6.poster.avif?t=1750793090\" width=400 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/1d270a958d9d37663666b29e69ea33c6.webm?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/1d270a958d9d37663666b29e69ea33c6.mp4?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find trees across your island to chop to gain resources! These materials can be used to craft furniture and other decorative blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand to Limitless Bounds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/64fde664439eea7d3be7a2df091f7f4c.poster.avif?t=1750793090\" width=400 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/64fde664439eea7d3be7a2df091f7f4c.webm?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/64fde664439eea7d3be7a2df091f7f4c.mp4?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm more and more crops to expand your island as far as you want. More land means more crops and the cycle repeats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, craft, farm, and build  as a Cat  in Cats and Cows. Paint and design your island landscape, build farms and expand your island to build your farming empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm from a selection of 14 different crops!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/0aa009d80ea806254686d3448dbf11e4.poster.avif?t=1750793090\" width=400 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/0aa009d80ea806254686d3448dbf11e4.webm?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/0aa009d80ea806254686d3448dbf11e4.mp4?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with less exotic crops, then sell and trade to acquire more exotic and expensive crops! Each crop can either be sold for money or can be traded for landscape block to expand your island.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect materials around your island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/1d270a958d9d37663666b29e69ea33c6.poster.avif?t=1750793090\" width=400 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/1d270a958d9d37663666b29e69ea33c6.webm?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/1d270a958d9d37663666b29e69ea33c6.mp4?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find trees across your island to chop to gain resources! These materials can be used to craft furniture and other decorative blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand to Limitless Bounds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/64fde664439eea7d3be7a2df091f7f4c.poster.avif?t=1750793090\" width=400 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/64fde664439eea7d3be7a2df091f7f4c.webm?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492380/extras/64fde664439eea7d3be7a2df091f7f4c.mp4?t=1750793090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm more and more crops to expand your island as far as you want. More land means more crops and the cycle repeats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
